        #if(isAPIKeys):
          <div class="page narrow">
            <header class="page-header">
              <div class="page-title"><h1>API keys</h1><p>Connect scripts and services to your Flowboard workspace.</p></div>
            </header>
            <div class="settings-grid">
              <nav class="settings-menu" aria-label="Account settings">
                <a class="nav-link" href="/app/settings"><i data-lucide="user"></i><span>Profile</span></a>
                <a class="nav-link active" href="/app/settings/api-keys" aria-current="page"><i data-lucide="key-round"></i><span>API keys</span></a>
              </nav>
              <div class="settings-content">
                #if(apiKeys.hasError):
                  <p class="error-message" role="alert">#(apiKeys.error)</p>
                #endif

                #if(apiKeys.hasCreatedKey):
                  <section class="section api-key-created" aria-labelledby="created-key-title">
                    <div class="section-heading">
                      <div><h2 id="created-key-title">Copy your new key</h2><p>This secret will not appear again after you leave this page.</p></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="panel panel-form">
                      <code class="api-key-secret">#(apiKeys.createdKey)</code>
                      <p class="api-key-warning">Store this key in a secret manager. Do not add it to source control or client-side code.</p>
                    </div>
                  </section>
                #endif

                <section class="section" aria-labelledby="create-key-title">
                  <div class="section-heading">
                    <div><h2 id="create-key-title">Create a key</h2><p>Use a name that identifies the script or service.</p></div>
                  </div>
                  <form class="panel panel-form" method="post" action="/app/settings/api-keys" data-turbo="false">
                    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="#(common.csrfToken)" />
                    <div class="field">
                      <label for="api-key-name">Name</label>
                      <input class="input" id="api-key-name" name="name" placeholder="Release automation" minlength="1" maxlength="80" required />
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit"><i data-lucide="plus"></i>Create key</button></div>
                  </form>
                </section>

                <section class="section" aria-labelledby="active-keys-title">
                  <div class="section-heading">
                    <div><h2 id="active-keys-title">Active keys</h2><p>Revoke a key when a service no longer needs access.</p></div>
                  </div>
                  #if(apiKeys.hasKeys):
                    <div class="panel">
                      #for(key in apiKeys.keys):
                        <div class="panel-row api-key-row">
                          <i data-lucide="key-round"></i>
                          <span class="panel-row-main">
                            <strong>#(key.name) · <code>#(key.prefix)…</code></strong>
                            <span>Created #(key.createdAt) · Expires #(key.expiresAt) · Last used #(key.lastUsedAt)</span>
                          </span>
                          <form method="post" action="/app/settings/api-keys/#(key.id)/revoke">
                            <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="#(common.csrfToken)" />
                            <button class="button danger small" type="submit">Revoke</button>
                          </form>
                        </div>
                      #endfor
                    </div>
                  #else:
                    <div class="panel"><div class="panel-row"><span class="panel-row-main"><strong>No API keys</strong><span>Create a key when you are ready to connect an integration.</span></span></div></div>
                  #endif
                </section>

                <section class="section" aria-labelledby="use-key-title">
                  <div class="section-heading">
                    <div><h2 id="use-key-title">Use an API key</h2><p>Send the key as a Bearer credential on every API request.</p></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="panel panel-form api-key-docs">
                    <h3>Authentication header</h3>
                    <pre><code>Authorization: Bearer fbk_YOUR_KEY</code></pre>
                    <h3>Search tasks</h3>
                    <pre><code>curl -H 'Authorization: Bearer fbk_YOUR_KEY' \
  '#(apiKeys.apiBaseURL)/tasks/search?q=release&amp;priority=high'</code></pre>
                    <h3>Common endpoints</h3>
                    <dl class="api-endpoints">
                      <div><dt><code>GET, POST /boards</code></dt><dd>List accessible boards or create a board.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>GET, PATCH, DELETE /boards/{boardID}</code></dt><dd>Read, update, or delete one board.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>/boards/{boardID}/members</code></dt><dd>List, add, change, or remove board members.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>/boards/{boardID}/views</code></dt><dd>Manage saved Board, Table, Calendar, and Gallery views.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>/boards/{boardID}/templates</code></dt><dd>Manage task templates and create tasks from them.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>GET, POST /tasks</code></dt><dd>List filtered tasks or create a task.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>GET /tasks/search?q=query</code></dt><dd>Search task titles, descriptions, and public IDs.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>GET, PATCH, DELETE /tasks/{taskID}</code></dt><dd>Read, partially update, or delete one task.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>POST /tasks/{taskID}/move</code></dt><dd>Move a task to a status and zero-based index.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>/tasks/{taskID}/comments</code></dt><dd>List, create, update, or delete comments.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>/tasks/{taskID}/checklist</code></dt><dd>Manage and reorder checklist items.</dd></div>
                      <div><dt><code>/tasks/{taskID}/followers</code></dt><dd>List followers or follow and unfollow a visible task.</dd></div>
                    </dl>
                    <p>All resource paths start with <code>#(apiKeys.apiBaseURL)</code>. Task list and search requests accept <code>page</code>, <code>per</code>, <code>boardID</code>, <code>status</code>, <code>priority</code>, <code>assigneeID</code>, and <code>archived</code>. Board lists accept <code>q</code> and <code>archived</code>.</p>
                    <p>PATCH requests change only supplied fields, and JSON <code>null</code> clears nullable values. API keys use your account and board roles. A key cannot create or revoke another key.</p>
                  </div>
                </section>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        #endif
